      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "An unusual presentation of a neurilemmoma in the cerebellopontine (CP) angle is reported. The tumour was localised in the CP angle and the case presented with post-auricular swelling and erosion of the squamous part of temporal bone without involvement of the auditory or other cranial nerves."},
